<http://data.silknow.org/object/dc875168-4aaf-3485-a645-86860486490c>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "SILK PILE TABLE or ALTAR  CARPET\nKnotted silk pile on silk warp with silk welt;\n282sehna knots to the square inch.\nCHINESE, 1800-1850, Qing dynasty\nT.556-1919 [?]"@en , "Table cover of silk, knotted in the manner of a carpet, in blue, green, red and deep yellow, on a deep yellow background. The pattern consists of an oblong compartment outlined with key ornamentation, which gets bigger in the corners. Filling this oblong compartment is a representation of the sun, surrounded by conventional leafy stems bearing a variety of flowers. In the spaces between the flowers are bats and homonyms for happiness. There is a wide border, filled with bats of the same kind of floral stems in the main pattern."@en , "Table cover of knotted silk, China, 18th century"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/92dda1af-1318-3d54-b107-75a06300fc77> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/b7ec0b6a-bf20-379b-b156-497892a72286> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "SILK PILE TABLE or ALTAR  CARPET\nKnotted silk pile on silk warp with silk welt;\n282sehna knots to the square inch.\nCHINESE, 1800-1850, Qing dynasty\nT.556-1919 [?]"@en , "Table cover of silk, knotted in the manner of a carpet, in blue, green, red and deep yellow, on a deep yellow background. The pattern consists of an oblong compartment outlined with key ornamentation, which gets bigger in the corners. Filling this oblong compartment is a representation of the sun, surrounded by conventional leafy stems bearing a variety of flowers. In the spaces between the flowers are bats and homonyms for happiness. There is a wide border, filled with bats of the same kind of floral stems in the main pattern."@en , "Table cover of knotted silk, China, 18th century"@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/dc875168-4aaf-3485-a645-86860486490c/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/dc875168-4aaf-3485-a645-86860486490c/dimension/1> ;
